                "frametrail:name": "What this is",
                "frametrail:attributes": {
                    "text": "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 26px;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;One painting, three voices&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;An art historian, a folklorist and a nine-year-old each wrote notes on the same film. Their notes are separate layers: choose a voice on the right, or follow the rows below. To add a voice of your own, click the pencil and continue as a guest.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;",
